You must declare a minor prior to passing your doctoral program’s preliminary oral exam.

Contact us at icdapply@umn.edu if you have any questions before declaring your minor. Once you're ready, you can declare your minor via OneStop.", "cdProgramAdmissionOtherTest": false, "cdProgramAdmissionTOEFL": false, "cdProgramCareer": "Graduate", "cdProgramCreditsDoctMinorMax": "12", "cdProgramCreditsDoctMinorMin": "12", "cdProgramDeliveryAddl": ["In-person/classroom"], "cdProgramDeliveryAddlHybridType": [], "cdProgramDeliveryPrimary": "In-person/classroom", "cdProgramDescr": "Graduate students pursuing a doctoral degree in other fields may complete a doctoral minor in developmental psychology. Students will take foundational courses in cognitive, social, and emotional development. ", "cdProgramDisplayCatalog": true, "cdProgramDualDeg": false, "cdProgramFieldofStudy": "Social Sciences and Human Services", "cdProgramGPAGoodStanding": "2.800", "cdProgramGradMinor4xxx": false, "cdProgramGradMinorLevel": "Doctoral", "cdProgramLOs": "<p>Over the course of a student’s graduate career, the faculty has agreed that students should have acquired experience, skills and competency with the objectives listed below in mind.<br><br>1) Ethical Conduct of Research<br>2) Application of Research Methods<br>3) Developing Funding Opportunities<br>4) Research Dissemination<br>5) Career Development</p>", "cdProgramLengthInTermsGrad": 3, "cdProgramMinorType": "Minor related to a major", "cdProgramNameShort": "Dev Psy", "cdProgramReqLanguageGrad": false, "cdProgramReqSubplanGrad": true, "cdProgramStatus": "Active", "cdProgramSubplanMoreThanOne": false, "cdProgramSumTerms": false, "cdProgramTypeManual": "Graduate minor", "cdProgramWebsite": "<p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="open_in_new_tab" href="https://icd.umn.edu/academics/developmental-psychology/phd-minor">https://icd.umn.edu/academics/developmental-psychology/phd-minor</a></p>", "feV9J": "<p>No curriculum changes in the Fall 2026 catalog update</p>", "g9JMc": false, "o8EfQ": false, "reportAsNscProgram": false, 